WEBVTT

00:00:06.160 --> 00:00:07.220
Hero...

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:09.820
you made it this far.

00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:11.690
I congratulate you.

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:14.450
This is no time for your jokes,

00:00:14.740 --> 00:00:15.630
Cain!

00:00:17.490 --> 00:00:18.460
Why did you do that?

00:00:19.410 --> 00:00:22.160
You knew this would happen to you! Why?!

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:26.180
Those twelve very special Familiars...

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:29.990
I couldn't leave them to Ki and the others.

00:00:30.550 --> 00:00:32.470
This is the best solution.

00:00:32.760 --> 00:00:35.510
Soon you will understand too.

00:00:38.140 --> 00:00:41.720
Glenda, forgive me. I entrust the rest to you

00:00:50.290 --> 00:00:50.980
Cain!

00:00:55.290 --> 00:00:57.650
Ah, how wonderful.

00:00:57.810 --> 00:01:00.190
Is this the light of dawn?

00:01:02.620 --> 00:01:05.160
Farewell, Fourth Progenitor.

00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:10.750
I hope the one who will inherit yours
memories and your blood will be happy.

00:01:13.620 --> 00:01:14.520
Cain!

00:02:57.960 --> 00:03:00.700
Oh, Heck. You are late, Kisaki Kiriha!

00:03:00.880 --> 00:03:04.880
I'm so sorry. I was finishing my bath.

00:03:04.980 --> 00:03:06.180
Isn't so, Yume-chan?

00:03:06.510 --> 00:03:08.930
It also took me some time
to choose the underwear.

00:03:09.140 --> 00:03:09.820
Look.

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:12.380
And why did you take a bath at this hour?

00:03:12.460 --> 00:03:17.070
Because is possible for Akatsuki Kojou to suck our blood, right?

00:03:17.260 --> 00:03:19.330
I don't want he can think I smell bad.

00:03:19.810 --> 00:03:22.840
Also, something else could happen.

00:03:23.040 --> 00:03:28.350
Although perhaps to an expert like you, it might seem superfluous.

00:03:28.470 --> 00:03:29.800
Expert?

00:03:29.860 --> 00:03:31.740
Just because he sucked my blood once?

00:03:31.970 --> 00:03:35.400
Rather, think about what you say in front of a child like Yume-chan!

00:03:35.460 --> 00:03:39.800
Don't worry. Maybe you don't see it, but
I am the strongest succubus in the world.

00:03:39.960 --> 00:03:41.660
So I know the matter.

00:03:42.160 --> 00:03:43.700
Do you understand, you two?

00:03:43.850 --> 00:03:46.180
Several things could happen, but

00:03:46.260 --> 00:03:49.480
Kojou-san's official wife will be me!

00:03:49.700 --> 00:03:52.030
Don't forget this, okay?

00:03:55.600 --> 00:03:57.590
Justina Kataya, Infiltrator Knight.

00:03:57.820 --> 00:03:59.820
Forgive the delay in introducing me to you.

00:04:00.440 --> 00:04:02.270
Your Highness, soon,

00:04:02.330 --> 00:04:04.620
you will be engaged on the battlefield.

00:04:05.200 --> 00:04:07.200
I have been entrusted with an artifact

00:04:07.340 --> 00:04:09.340
and I'm here to deliver it to you.

00:04:10.080 --> 00:04:12.400
note: Skuld, "who bears the shield" is a major Valkyrie.
The legacy of Aldegyr's royal family,

00:04:12.400 --> 00:04:12.760
note: Skuld, "who bears the shield" is a major Valkyrie.

00:04:12.760 --> 00:04:14.480
the shield of Skuld.
note: Skuld, "who bears the shield" is a major Valkyrie.

00:04:14.760 --> 00:04:16.430
It will certainly be useful to me.

00:04:16.990 --> 00:04:20.050
Th-That metal comes from the age of the Gods?!

00:04:20.280 --> 00:04:23.420
Kanon please, lend me
for a while that bracelet!

00:04:23.550 --> 00:04:26.260
A little, just a moment, really!

00:04:26.580 --> 00:04:29.820
Justina-san, I have a question for you.

00:04:30.160 --> 00:04:32.180
Here on Itogami Island,

00:04:32.280 --> 00:04:34.400
are you the only one back, Justina-san?

00:04:39.980 --> 00:04:45.260
Yaze-senpai said it is absolutely necessary for Akatsuki-senpai to come to his senses.

00:04:45.610 --> 00:04:48.150
So I wore it, but...

00:04:48.380 --> 00:04:52.330
Looking back, I get the impression
that he made fun of us.

00:04:53.840 --> 00:04:56.410
Kasugaya-san, it looks like you are shaking.

00:04:56.480 --> 00:04:57.580
Everything is alright?

00:04:57.710 --> 00:05:01.820
For the success of the operation,
your role is crucial, Kasugaya-san.

00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:05.840
I... am like you.

00:05:07.230 --> 00:05:10.600
I was also the observer of Kojou,

00:05:10.790 --> 00:05:12.190
on the Onrai island.

00:05:12.550 --> 00:05:15.840
That happened in a virtual world, but...

00:05:16.190 --> 00:05:20.870
Anyway, Kojou is still the
subject of my observation.

00:05:21.200 --> 00:05:25.120
I can't lose sight of him because
he is a precious friend and I...

00:05:25.930 --> 00:05:29.560
So do not worry, I will not back down!

00:05:29.900 --> 00:05:33.520
If necessary, I will be his blood mate or whatever.

00:05:33.820 --> 00:05:35.390
And even if it were for eternity,

00:05:35.490 --> 00:05:39.450
it is my duty as Paladiness of Gisela to continue to watch over him.

00:05:39.760 --> 00:05:41.200
Oh, well... You know...

00:05:41.270 --> 00:05:46.590
What I wanted to know is not how you feel about Akatsuki-senpai, but...

00:05:46.790 --> 00:05:50.460
Kasugaya-san, what are yours
conditions? Given your wounds...

00:05:53.320 --> 00:05:56.220
Since we started, confess you too!

00:05:56.380 --> 00:05:58.950
How do you feel about Kojou?

00:05:59.260 --> 00:06:03.600
Th-This is... being his observer,
there would be a lot to say, but...

00:06:03.720 --> 00:06:06.780
It's as a woman that I am asking you!

00:06:07.160 --> 00:06:08.840
Wh-What..?!

00:06:13.040 --> 00:06:15.140
Motoki, their clothes...

00:06:15.900 --> 00:06:17.950
will they really have any effect?

00:06:18.120 --> 00:06:19.160
Of course!

00:06:19.340 --> 00:06:21.140
There is no man who wouldn't adore them.

00:06:21.370 --> 00:06:23.900
If they can't seduce Kojou,

00:06:24.080 --> 00:06:28.120
the problem is not the dress, but
the attractiveness of Himeragi and-

00:06:28.580 --> 00:06:29.180
Hey!

00:06:29.260 --> 00:06:30.970
Don't aim that cannon at me!

00:06:33.400 --> 00:06:35.320
We got there on time, it seems.

00:06:35.580 --> 00:06:36.650
Nagisa-chan!

00:06:37.610 --> 00:06:38.900
Why are you here?

00:06:39.180 --> 00:06:40.690
Ah, in fact...

00:06:40.750 --> 00:06:42.560
I forced her to bring me here!

00:06:42.700 --> 00:06:43.500
Why?

00:06:43.840 --> 00:06:45.300
Why are you asking this?!

00:06:45.390 --> 00:06:47.800
Kojou-kun is in a bad situation.

00:06:47.880 --> 00:06:50.810
Yukina-chan, you are all
trying to help him, aren't you?

00:06:51.160 --> 00:06:53.370
So it is obvious that I came to help you!

00:06:53.660 --> 00:06:55.500
However, Nagisa-chan...

00:06:55.590 --> 00:06:56.660
Be careful!

00:06:56.940 --> 00:06:59.440
There is no more time to waste!

00:06:59.890 --> 00:07:02.960
I detect a source of magical power... and it's huge!

00:07:05.870 --> 00:07:06.580
Motoki!

00:07:06.780 --> 00:07:07.540
Get it!

00:07:08.080 --> 00:07:09.320
Nagisa-san, over here!

00:07:10.450 --> 00:07:13.220
Servants of Akatsuki Kojou's blood,

00:07:13.490 --> 00:07:15.230
it's time to honor your promise.

00:07:15.460 --> 00:07:18.700
Let me appreciate your skills.

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:22.010
Himeragi-san, Kasugaya-san!
Let's start!

00:07:22.170 --> 00:07:22.920
Yes!

00:07:33.550 --> 00:07:34.770
From now on,

00:07:34.880 --> 00:07:36.290
this is our battle!

00:07:36.840 --> 00:07:37.580
Right.

00:07:46.760 --> 00:07:49.320
Is that... Akatsuki Kojou?

00:07:49.490 --> 00:07:50.900
Shio-chan, let's go!

00:07:53.950 --> 00:07:56.650
Rozen Cavalier Plus. Activation!

00:08:01.180 --> 00:08:02.120
Activation!

00:08:05.940 --> 00:08:06.580
Shio-chan!

00:08:07.690 --> 00:08:11.770
User authentication!
Freikugel Plus, crossbow mode.

00:08:11.880 --> 00:08:12.790
Unlock!

00:08:16.100 --> 00:08:17.260
Take this!

00:08:24.270 --> 00:08:26.080
Wake up, Rain Gold!

00:08:30.280 --> 00:08:34.340
Do you eat time and space
with the Dimension Eater, huh?

00:08:34.380 --> 00:08:34.940
Umph...

00:08:40.560 --> 00:08:43.230
How does it feel to devour yourself?

00:08:43.900 --> 00:08:44.850
Kisaki Kiriha,

00:08:44.900 --> 00:08:46.300
on this side you take care of it!

00:08:47.130 --> 00:08:50.350
Seriously, she let me cover her back?

00:08:50.600 --> 00:08:52.130
Is she really an idiot?

00:08:53.220 --> 00:08:55.170
Really, I don't understand her.

00:09:02.320 --> 00:09:04.940
What a tremendous magical power we have here.

00:09:10.630 --> 00:09:13.660
Facing him head-on, I will only lose power.

00:09:18.010 --> 00:09:19.580
Akatsuki Kojou...

00:09:20.000 --> 00:09:21.040
Yukina!

00:09:25.080 --> 00:09:28.500
War Dancer of the High God, as a dancer of the Lion, beseech thee...

00:09:28.920 --> 00:09:31.510
Enku of the Aurora, Qilin of radiant light,

00:09:31.660 --> 00:09:34.740
thou who doth rule thunder and the heavens, come clad in raging fire,

00:09:34.930 --> 00:09:36.740
to pierce Hell's monstrous demons!

00:09:42.600 --> 00:09:43.730
You let your guard down!

00:09:44.020 --> 00:09:47.700
The dimensional distortion allowed her to deflect the shot and get around him.

00:09:48.780 --> 00:09:49.640
Not bad.

00:09:49.920 --> 00:09:50.840
It worked!

00:09:53.800 --> 00:09:56.020
Dirty Beast!
Don't you dare get close!

00:09:56.100 --> 00:09:56.820
Yume-san ?!

00:09:59.710 --> 00:10:02.210
Are you trying to mentally control me?

00:10:03.190 --> 00:10:04.590
Don't underestimate Lilith.

00:10:05.160 --> 00:10:08.990
I am the most powerful succubus in the world!

00:10:09.410 --> 00:10:10.410
In front of me,

00:10:10.460 --> 00:10:12.370
you must bow down!

00:10:19.000 --> 00:10:19.880
Your Highness!

00:10:24.180 --> 00:10:26.080
We don't have to attack him anymore.

00:10:26.920 --> 00:10:28.010
So what do we do?

00:10:28.260 --> 00:10:31.440
If we do nothing but defend ourselves, it will never end.

00:10:31.720 --> 00:10:32.950
Everything will be fine.

00:10:42.680 --> 00:10:45.420
The protection system of the Aldegyr royal family?

00:10:45.690 --> 00:10:47.730
However, this amount of magical energy..?

00:10:49.380 --> 00:10:50.840
Angel Faux?

00:10:51.100 --> 00:10:51.960
Sure...

00:10:52.230 --> 00:10:55.280
That bracelet works like the spear of the Lion King.

00:10:55.360 --> 00:10:56.920
It's a divine vibration's catalyst!

00:11:00.870 --> 00:11:02.690
note:"terrible winter", in Norse mythology, heralds
the arrival of the Ragnarok, the end of the world.
This is the Fimbulvetr?!

00:11:02.690 --> 00:11:03.390
note:"terrible winter", in Norse mythology, heralds
the arrival of the Ragnarok, the end of the world.

00:11:03.390 --> 00:11:06.700
Your Highness, you have used the hardest spell!
note:"terrible winter", in Norse mythology, heralds
the arrival of the Ragnarok, the end of the world.

00:11:08.350 --> 00:11:10.120
Kanon-chan, magnificent!

00:11:13.340 --> 00:11:14.460
Goes bad!

00:11:14.910 --> 00:11:17.690
Asagi, can you stop him with your Seisen?

00:11:17.890 --> 00:11:19.150
Don't ask for the impossible!

00:11:19.240 --> 00:11:22.420
I can barely handle the magic calculations to get Kojou back to normal.

00:11:28.890 --> 00:11:33.610
It seems that here is the time that
Kojou's future wife intervenes.

00:11:33.820 --> 00:11:34.720
That voice...

00:11:35.140 --> 00:11:36.130
You!

00:11:46.560 --> 00:11:47.400
Captain,

00:11:47.710 --> 00:11:49.460
cast the cursed chains to starboard.

00:11:49.500 --> 00:11:51.700
Cancel the Familiar's gravity check.

00:11:52.060 --> 00:11:54.990
After imprisoning him in the sacred barrier,

00:11:55.060 --> 00:11:56.890
get closer to the target.

00:11:57.280 --> 00:11:58.260
Yes, sir!

00:11:58.520 --> 00:12:00.160
Maximum spiritual power!

00:12:00.260 --> 00:12:02.260
Creation of the sacred barrier!

00:12:04.760 --> 00:12:06.360
How long can you keep it?

00:12:06.420 --> 00:12:08.290
About 90 seconds.

00:12:09.060 --> 00:12:10.380
More than enough.

00:12:10.850 --> 00:12:13.220
Daughter of the gods that is within me...

00:12:13.640 --> 00:12:16.220
Protector of armies, age of the sword,

00:12:16.340 --> 00:12:18.970
bringer of victory and deliverer of death!

00:12:20.860 --> 00:12:23.270
It is time for the glorious battle to begin!

00:12:23.440 --> 00:12:26.530
Obey the command of the
shining goddess and hurry here!

00:12:26.620 --> 00:12:28.860
note: Weland the Blacksmith, from Norse mythology.
Let the gate open, Völundr!

00:12:28.860 --> 00:12:28.880
note: Weland the Blacksmith, from Norse mythology.

00:12:40.140 --> 00:12:42.450
She doesn't take it easy, that princess.

00:12:42.600 --> 00:12:44.750
However, so the main problem is solved.

00:12:45.540 --> 00:12:46.320
Warning.

00:12:46.500 --> 00:12:49.250
Materialization of a new Familiar confirmed.

00:12:49.370 --> 00:12:51.680
Za-Blood's Twelfth Familiar,

00:12:51.880 --> 00:12:53.600
Primus Glacies.

00:12:58.690 --> 00:13:00.840
Esexcuto. Rododactylos.

00:13:05.020 --> 00:13:06.390
Astarte-san!

00:13:06.700 --> 00:13:09.990
That little girl is a homonculus
in symbiosis with a Familiar.

00:13:10.990 --> 00:13:12.790
However, unlike a vampire,

00:13:12.890 --> 00:13:16.260
she provides magical power to the Beast sacrificing her life energy.

00:13:16.860 --> 00:13:18.960
If this continues, very soon she...

00:13:21.860 --> 00:13:22.640
Wait up!

00:13:22.820 --> 00:13:23.740
Nagisa-chan!

00:13:24.010 --> 00:13:24.860
I...

00:13:25.120 --> 00:13:27.640
I can't fight like Kanon-san or Yukina-san,

00:13:27.810 --> 00:13:30.470
but I know how to communicate with the Familiars!

00:13:41.150 --> 00:13:42.600
Primus Glacies!

00:13:43.770 --> 00:13:47.880
Primus Glacies...
that's your name, right?

00:13:49.820 --> 00:13:52.340
Come, Primus Glacies.

00:13:55.520 --> 00:13:56.710
Very well.

00:13:56.920 --> 00:13:58.100
Good girl.

00:13:58.810 --> 00:14:00.970
Hey, hey, I can't believe it.

00:14:01.200 --> 00:14:04.840
A Progenitor's Familiar who obeys a human?

00:14:07.200 --> 00:14:07.960
Hauras!

00:14:10.110 --> 00:14:11.080
Kasugaya-san!

00:14:11.960 --> 00:14:15.000
Thanks to the Blessing
of Gisela, I don't feel pain.

00:14:15.110 --> 00:14:18.320
Rather, you are moving slower, right?

00:14:20.110 --> 00:14:21.080
Sekkarou!

00:14:27.290 --> 00:14:28.420
Oh, Heck!

00:14:28.860 --> 00:14:30.270
Don't get in the way!

00:14:30.350 --> 00:14:32.110
Sensha-Nori, accelerate!

00:14:32.280 --> 00:14:33.780
Bring us as close as possible.

00:14:33.860 --> 00:14:36.370
Even using all the energy of the Itogami Island,

00:14:36.690 --> 00:14:39.320
to get Kojou back to normal
we only have one try!

00:14:39.550 --> 00:14:41.650
We absolutely cannot fail!

00:14:41.740 --> 00:14:42.870
Yes, sir!

00:14:51.900 --> 00:14:53.800
Why is Kojou walking away?

00:14:54.170 --> 00:14:56.180
Weren't the bunny girl supposed to attract him?

00:14:56.500 --> 00:14:59.440
Why did you say that nonsense?
Motoki, pervert!

00:14:59.860 --> 00:15:02.420
If you are being chased it's natural to escape, right?

00:15:02.600 --> 00:15:06.160
In his current state, Kojou acts by pure instinct.

00:15:07.060 --> 00:15:08.030
I get it.

00:15:08.100 --> 00:15:09.870
We don't have to chase him,

00:15:09.960 --> 00:15:13.250
but to make him come to us.

00:15:13.340 --> 00:15:14.680
As in love.

00:15:15.000 --> 00:15:15.800
In love?

00:15:16.840 --> 00:15:19.060
Spare me these stories.

00:15:19.330 --> 00:15:22.540
If the bunny girls don't work,
do we have to force our way?

00:15:25.420 --> 00:15:26.430
Aiba-senpai,

00:15:26.550 --> 00:15:28.420
I entrust Akatsuki-senpai to you.

00:15:28.560 --> 00:15:30.080
No, Himeragi-san!

00:15:31.480 --> 00:15:33.600
Himeragi Yukina,
What do you want to do?

00:15:34.200 --> 00:15:36.060
My angelization is at the limit by now.

00:15:36.700 --> 00:15:38.630
I won't be able to fight anymore.

00:15:39.120 --> 00:15:39.770
So...

00:15:41.380 --> 00:15:42.680
Akatsuki-senpai.

00:15:49.780 --> 00:15:50.650
Le Bleu!

00:15:52.370 --> 00:15:54.410
I'll take care of these three.

00:15:54.500 --> 00:15:55.690
You take care of the rest.

00:15:56.080 --> 00:15:57.730
Go, Jotei-dono!

00:15:57.840 --> 00:16:00.180
I'll help her with those three!

00:16:01.030 --> 00:16:01.770
Thank you.

00:16:02.820 --> 00:16:04.730
Kojou is finally isolated.

00:16:04.890 --> 00:16:06.960
Surely this will be ours...

00:16:07.240 --> 00:16:08.720
only opportunity.

00:16:19.450 --> 00:16:20.500
Akatsuki...

00:16:22.640 --> 00:16:23.760
Senpai.

00:16:29.640 --> 00:16:33.680
I can't let Himeragi shed any more blood.

00:16:33.770 --> 00:16:36.090
You'll have to settle for my blood!

00:16:38.230 --> 00:16:39.220
Aiba Asagi...

00:16:39.320 --> 00:16:40.040
Get it now!

00:16:40.180 --> 00:16:41.030
I'm ready!

00:16:41.580 --> 00:16:43.220
I got you Kojou!

00:16:43.980 --> 00:16:46.180
At this distance you will not escape me!

00:16:46.640 --> 00:16:48.200
Mogwai! Activate the Seisen!

00:16:50.660 --> 00:16:53.770
This pain is a gift from Himeragi-san.

00:16:54.070 --> 00:16:55.610
I alone,

00:16:55.700 --> 00:16:57.980
couldn't get you back to normal.

00:16:58.380 --> 00:17:01.350
So I asked Himeragi-san to control the magic...

00:17:01.940 --> 00:17:04.000
to get you back to normal, Akatsuki Kojou,

00:17:04.120 --> 00:17:07.320
Himeragi-san has always been your observer,

00:17:07.400 --> 00:17:11.310
and Himeragi-san is best suited to remembering what you were like as a true Fourth Progenitor!

00:17:11.480 --> 00:17:14.260
Akatsuki Kojou, it's thanks to her that
you will get your true appearance back!

00:17:15.100 --> 00:17:17.280
Himera... gi...

00:17:33.510 --> 00:17:34.380
Kasuko.

00:17:35.800 --> 00:17:36.740
Asagi.

00:17:44.420 --> 00:17:45.500
Himeragi!

00:17:48.450 --> 00:17:49.780
Akatsuki Kojou.

00:17:49.830 --> 00:17:50.700
Kojou-kun.

00:17:51.420 --> 00:17:52.700
Akatsuki Kojou.

00:17:52.830 --> 00:17:54.040
Kojou-san!

00:17:55.160 --> 00:17:56.880
You always causes problems.

00:17:57.320 --> 00:17:58.300
Onii-san...

00:17:58.520 --> 00:18:00.360
You're finally back, mate.

00:18:00.480 --> 00:18:01.730
Kojou-kun.

00:18:02.380 --> 00:18:03.310
Kojou...

00:18:04.120 --> 00:18:04.740
Kojou.

00:18:05.440 --> 00:18:06.740
Akatsuki Kojou.

00:18:08.660 --> 00:18:09.550
You idiot!

00:18:11.070 --> 00:18:13.360
Welcome back, Senpai.

00:18:14.500 --> 00:18:16.570
I'm back, Himeragi.

00:18:29.730 --> 00:18:33.590
But... why they obey me
without making objections?

00:18:34.120 --> 00:18:36.590
Because you sucked Kasugaya-san's blood.

00:18:36.690 --> 00:18:38.340
Kasuko's blood...

00:18:38.420 --> 00:18:39.250
Only for this?

00:18:39.700 --> 00:18:40.420
Take this.

00:18:40.920 --> 00:18:41.910
Congratulations,

00:18:42.090 --> 00:18:44.490
vampire resident in the South of the island,

00:18:44.660 --> 00:18:46.800
AK, 17.

00:18:47.160 --> 00:18:48.550
But... this is me!

00:18:48.630 --> 00:18:50.970
Why am I first in the ranking of the Lords?

00:18:51.180 --> 00:18:54.070
Also there is an abyss from the second and third.

00:18:54.520 --> 00:18:56.090
And the other Progenitors?

00:18:56.520 --> 00:18:58.450
The First Progenitor, Ki,

00:18:58.560 --> 00:19:01.350
was affiliated to the Domain
of Yume and did not participate.

00:19:01.670 --> 00:19:04.500
Giada-san has been cooperative
from the very beginning.

00:19:04.640 --> 00:19:07.550
With the Second Progenitor
I negotiated and she accepted.

00:19:07.840 --> 00:19:10.920
Although now Haba-san has to take care of digestive for the stomach, though.

00:19:11.110 --> 00:19:11.920
Digestives?

00:19:12.000 --> 00:19:12.680
And therefore,

00:19:12.880 --> 00:19:15.330
with their territories acquired in the East and South,

00:19:15.380 --> 00:19:19.100
and adding the territories of the second in
rankings conquered by Natsuki-chan,

00:19:19.240 --> 00:19:23.280
we have acquired about 90% of the inhabitants of the Itogami island.

00:19:23.530 --> 00:19:27.420
By bringing them all together, we
made them Kasugaya-san's subjects.

00:19:27.950 --> 00:19:29.180
And here's why,

00:19:29.380 --> 00:19:31.680
Kojou, when you sucked Kasugaya-san's blood,

00:19:31.800 --> 00:19:34.190
you made her your blood mate,

00:19:34.320 --> 00:19:36.980
and you, Kojou, have won the Selection of Lords.

00:19:37.680 --> 00:19:39.930
The Winner's Privilege... Do you remember?

00:19:40.750 --> 00:19:42.450
Collect the magic of the subjects?

00:19:42.630 --> 00:19:43.370
Exactly.

00:19:43.590 --> 00:19:45.320
Also for the Familiars,

00:19:45.460 --> 00:19:50.400
being fueled with magic by the inhabitants of the Itogami Island, should satisfy them.

00:19:50.600 --> 00:19:52.070
Fortunately, everything went well.

00:19:52.530 --> 00:19:56.200
So now, you have kept the title
of Lord of the Itogami island.

00:19:56.780 --> 00:19:59.240
Don't forget that, AK-san.

00:20:01.460 --> 00:20:02.770
Akatsuki-senpai.

00:20:03.680 --> 00:20:04.560
Himeragi,

00:20:04.700 --> 00:20:06.020
can you already get up?

00:20:06.080 --> 00:20:06.740
Yes,

00:20:06.800 --> 00:20:09.050
Nagisa-chan treated me.

00:20:09.130 --> 00:20:11.340
My injuries are no longer a problem now.

00:20:11.840 --> 00:20:14.570
Senpai, and you, how do you feel your body?

00:20:14.720 --> 00:20:18.070
It should be back now
in its original state, right?

00:20:18.770 --> 00:20:19.960
Asagi told me,

00:20:20.100 --> 00:20:21.950
that it was you Himeragi, to get me back.

00:20:22.390 --> 00:20:25.200
But I don't feel so different.

00:20:25.450 --> 00:20:26.620
Himeragi, what do you think?

00:20:26.880 --> 00:20:27.600
Well...

00:20:28.280 --> 00:20:31.010
You were more beautiful when you were human.

00:20:31.080 --> 00:20:33.900
It's a bit of a shame, but that's okay.

00:20:34.940 --> 00:20:35.860
Seriously?

00:20:36.680 --> 00:20:38.840
Kidding, I was kidding!

00:20:41.080 --> 00:20:42.010
Anyway...

00:20:42.260 --> 00:20:43.670
this thing is solved.

00:20:43.880 --> 00:20:45.230
You are right.

00:20:46.950 --> 00:20:47.810
Senpai...

00:20:48.640 --> 00:20:50.960
Could you suck my blood?

00:20:51.320 --> 00:20:51.920
What?

00:20:52.030 --> 00:20:53.490
Senpai, if I don't become partner-

00:20:53.840 --> 00:20:55.420
blood servant of the progenitor,

00:20:55.420 --> 00:20:57.700
I will no longer be able to use the Sekkarou.

00:20:57.800 --> 00:20:59.070
No, I can not.

00:20:59.180 --> 00:21:01.180
You have already shed too much blood.

00:21:01.560 --> 00:21:02.580
Also, I,

00:21:02.640 --> 00:21:04.540
now I'm practically...

00:21:04.680 --> 00:21:06.100
completely full.

00:21:06.220 --> 00:21:06.900
What?

00:21:09.640 --> 00:21:10.960
Senpai, by chance,

00:21:11.040 --> 00:21:14.440
while I was sleeping,
did you suck other girls' blood?

00:21:14.940 --> 00:21:17.240
This... This was inevitable!

00:21:17.460 --> 00:21:20.440
Astarte had to reconnect to the
spiritual channel of her Familiar,

00:21:20.800 --> 00:21:23.390
And also Kanase, having used Angel Faux...

00:21:23.500 --> 00:21:24.920
She was not very well.

00:21:25.140 --> 00:21:27.210
I can understand for Astarte-san, but

00:21:27.280 --> 00:21:28.430
Kanon-chan also?!

00:21:29.880 --> 00:21:31.280
Ah... by the way,

00:21:31.280 --> 00:21:33.560
Himeragi, I wanted to ask you something...

00:21:33.560 --> 00:21:35.080
Don't change the subject, please!

00:21:35.130 --> 00:21:38.000
Why were you dressed like a bunny girl?

00:21:38.400 --> 00:21:39.500
It's not what you think!

00:21:39.550 --> 00:21:42.640
I had to seduce you, Akatsuki-senpai.

00:21:42.720 --> 00:21:43.110
What?

00:21:43.340 --> 00:21:44.830
Seduce me?

00:21:44.890 --> 00:21:45.540
Ah...

00:21:45.800 --> 00:21:46.770
This is not it.

00:21:46.860 --> 00:21:51.510
Since the senpai was out of control, we had to lure you in and make you suck Kasugaya-san's blood.

00:21:51.680 --> 00:21:55.790
It was Yaze-senpai who said that Akatsuki-senpai would be drawn by those costumes!

00:21:55.880 --> 00:21:56.940
And so...

00:21:57.300 --> 00:21:58.050
Anyway,

00:21:58.100 --> 00:22:00.040
it's not what you think!

00:23:31.460 --> 00:23:32.640
Dodekatos...

00:23:32.940 --> 00:23:33.580
No...

00:23:33.740 --> 00:23:36.340
The Fourth Progenitor, has not yet been found?

00:23:36.440 --> 00:23:37.640
At the moment,

00:23:37.780 --> 00:23:40.140
no report has come that she has been identified.

00:23:41.500 --> 00:23:43.600
What do you think, Clade?

00:23:43.980 --> 00:23:46.660
It's probably Glenda's doing.

00:23:47.200 --> 00:23:49.020
But who is that girl?

00:23:49.740 --> 00:23:52.020
I heard she served Cain,

00:23:52.300 --> 00:23:55.240
but beyond that, I don't know much more.

00:23:55.920 --> 00:23:56.920
I get it.

00:23:58.110 --> 00:23:58.760
If so,

00:23:59.170 --> 00:24:02.480
she are likely to know the Node very well.

00:24:02.980 --> 00:24:04.870
Not surprising if we don't find her.

00:24:05.660 --> 00:24:06.620
What do we do?

00:24:07.020 --> 00:24:08.580
We don't lack time.

00:24:08.900 --> 00:24:11.400
We have time to keep looking for her.

00:24:16.020 --> 00:24:20.040
Is this... the true inheritance of the Sinful God?

00:24:20.300 --> 00:24:21.040
Yeah.

00:24:21.540 --> 00:24:23.030
The Sinful God Cain,

00:24:23.200 --> 00:24:26.870
sacrificed his life to create
this magical weapon.

00:24:27.470 --> 00:24:29.170
Able to burn the world to ashes,

00:24:29.380 --> 00:24:31.020
it is his sinister legacy.

00:24:31.730 --> 00:24:32.630
And also...

00:24:32.740 --> 00:24:35.980
the cursed power I must inherit.

00:24:36.540 --> 00:24:37.700
Familiars.
